            "sid": "JER 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA nagamba ati: “Obworaaba noosobora kucwa endagaano yange hamu n'obwire bwa nyamusana n'obw'ekiro, obwire nukwo bukalema kukya n'okwira omu kasumi kaabyo akaatairweho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu endagaano yange n'omwiru wange Daudi, nayo nubwo esobora kucwibwa, nukwo aburwe omwana w'obwojo ow'okuteera engoma ye, n'eya banyakatagara Abaleevi abanyakumpeereza, nayo nukwo eti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'ebintu eby'omumwanya okubitasobora kubarwa, n'omusenyi ogw'enyanja oku gutasobora kulengwa, n'abaijukuru ba Daudi omwiru wange, n'abanyakatagara Abaleevi abanyakumpeereza, nukwo ndibakanyisa nti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
